                  %mi B
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B s_i B
            where
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi s
                    %mi i
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} s_i
            is a Coxeter generator.
